[00:00.000] 作词 : Lars Halapi/Sophie Zelmani
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Lars Halapi/Sophie Zelmani
[00:22.117]I'll take you back
[00:27.715]To lake Geneva
[00:33.958]To the park where
[00:39.449]You'll meet your grief
[00:44.035]It sits on a bench
[00:50.634]With its head down
[00:55.222]The hole in his body
[01:01.245]We'll just let him speak
[01:09.407]I'll take, you by the hand
[01:15.267]I'll walk with you
[01:20.374]Until you'll somehow find a strength
[01:24.019]To look up again
[01:39.108]I'll take you back
[01:44.517]To lake Geneva
[01:50.806]Where your sorrow
[01:56.336]Is recognized
[02:02.302]Life gives
[02:07.888]And takes from us
[02:13.715]We'll share the burden
[02:19.218]Side by side
[02:27.239]I'll take, you by the hand
[02:33.106]I'll walk with you
[02:38.494]Until you'll somehow find a strength
[02:41.994]To look up again
